  to the one inbox reseller inquiries go to - never to the person who wrote.

  Every value below is what a visitor typed. Each row is plainText, which
  Handlebars escapes. messageHtml is the message with its line breaks kept:
  Home/Utils/ResellerInquiry.ts (getMessageHtml) escapes every line and adds
  nothing but the <br/> between them. replyUrl is a mailto: link whose two
  address parts that file percent-encodes (getReplyMailtoUrl).
--}}

